TORY-260908-18woqo: STORY-260908-18woqo: adopt-approved-normative-selector-and-auth-revision\\nb4c4349 TASK-260908-3kvnm2: TASK-260908-3kvnm2: pin-reviewed-approved-normative-source\\n7654d7c Record STORY-260908-2uhazl board state\\n30122c7 STORY-260908-2uhazl: STORY-260908-2uhazl: astra-producer-routing\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4235,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1059,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
