) != 1 || preview.BlockingPeers[0] != testPeerID2 {\n222|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"blocking peers = %v, want [%s]\", preview.BlockingPeers, testPeerID2)\n223|\t}\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
