{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000f7e9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a088d0-e609-7bb2-8da2-c35b2ea0a045"},"sequence":6735,"recorded_at":1780531400013465,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f897871b-85d1-4704-870d-e5ea0ee901cf","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"f897871b-85d1-4704-870d-e5ea0ee901cf","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f897871b-85d1-4704-870d-e5ea0ee901cf"},"call_id":"call_01a088f5e30577b2b56de5e5bd0d2297","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 4-6\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n-\n-## 2026-09-08\n+> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n+\n+## 2026-09-10\n+\n+### TASK-260909-2ez769 — Host Trust Store 1.0.0 + Config 4.0.0 migration implemented\n+- SCOPE: new `internal/hosttrust` (trust reader/writer, Profile-1 issuance/verify, custody, enroll/rotate/MarkRetiring/revoke, generation authz, export/exclusion); Config 4.0.0 reader/validator/encoder + Preview/Apply/Rollback in `internal/config`; v4 peeridentity interop test; secprim census extended to hosttrust.\n+- FINDING: peer rotation catch-up had no local path (only self-rotation). Added `Store.MarkRetiring` with the same 24h/enrolled_at bounds. `ensureOwnerDir` verifies existing dirs, never repairs: silent narrowing masked a widened dir (caught by TestCustodyRefusals).\n+- FINDING: Go x509 puts the CN ATV into Subject.Names (len 1), so CN-only means exactly one CN-OID ATV, not empty Names. Parsed-name check fixed in `profile_checks.go:subjectIsOnlyCN`.\n+- FINDING: encoding/json decodes `\"1\"` into json.Number; generation now requires a bare JSON number. Duplicate JSON keys audited via token stream before decode.\n+- DECISION: base refresh refused by tooling (\"candidate refresh requires the final unresolved leaf\"); no manual rebase. Candidate sits on c1eff01 citing v0.6.0 by value; adoption files not duplicated. Integration must land onto the adoption base.\n+- VALIDATION: 21/21 AC rows driven; 11 hosttrust + 3 config narrowing mutants killed (named), 1 label-precision kill, 2 neutral controls; `go test ./...` all ok; config refusal-inventory + secprim census green.\n+- STATUS: ready for review, worktree UNCOMMITTED for handoff snapshot.\n+\n+## 2026-09-08\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"LOGBOOK.md","added":14,"removed":3},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
